#: model:ir.model.fields,help:edi_queue_oca.field_edi_exchange_type__job_eta_enabled
msgid ""
"Accumulate all queue jobs for this exchange type and release them at the "
"daily time configured below, instead of dispatching each job immediately. "
"Use this when a trading partner only processes files at a fixed daily "
"window, or to concentrate resource-intensive EDI work in off-peak hours."
